    description: "UAT 2026-04-13 BUG-02+BUG-03: `-t 0` silently produces full 8000-token output (treated as 'no budget'). `-t -1` and `-t -100` produce header-only output (~985 bytes) with exit 0. Both should be rejected with a clear error before any work runs. A single argparse type-validator handles both."  # 0f84
