  message: "Fixed. Added _positive_token_budget argparse type validator that rejects 0, negative, and non-integer values up front. Wired into both --tokens flags (sketch and explain). Verified: 'hypergumbo . -t 0' now exits 2 with 'argument -t/--tokens: token budget must be a positive integer, got 0'."  # 4ad4
